{"steam_appid":2314160,"steam_name":"Tactical Assault VR","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2314160/539041510/e7b439d226baf072330a6b49482c29c3e47961c7/1783958232/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783960545","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111814/83d6cf76bd6fdb880219fc38c59e78376645e933/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783960545","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/ss_345a6deeeb87438a24fadccffefb69bd50a0dfbb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783960546","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/ss_b684f929b9557dc4ce3630981c0186273261b09e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783960546","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/ss_fefb79c252c634a54fd71ec0a86b626d23f67cb9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783960546","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/ss_cde6e97cfaec531c326d4c3d7099a56c2c997864.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783960546","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/ss_24f28920940a56a1f060f7682577433ee165630a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783960546"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of an elite special forces unit in Tactical Assault VR!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Assault VR is an intense tactical shooter where you use real-world CQB (Close Quarters Battles) tactics to stack up, breach doors and eliminate threats. Play solo or join an online co-op special forces unit in missions around the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvE Missions: Solo or Online Multiplayer Co-Op with Up to 8 Players on PCVR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/89188aef56ba00d83e1b7ebd67370e68.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP: Competitive Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/b6a9d070a021f28e736686a14e34b479.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >9 Non-Linear Asymmetrical Missions, 3 Wave Shooter Experiences, Room Randomizer &amp; Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your assault. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/87a4fe2bf125cdf7aae529b7d91be72f.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/87a4fe2bf125cdf7aae529b7d91be72f.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/87a4fe2bf125cdf7aae529b7d91be72f.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mode Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Defusal, Hostage Rescue, Enemy Surrendering, High-Value Target (HVT) Eliminations, Mini Games, Killhouse, Hardcore Mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/afc6f7b4f2837a0b76070fb07f553b6c.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/afc6f7b4f2837a0b76070fb07f553b6c.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/afc6f7b4f2837a0b76070fb07f553b6c.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >60+ Detailed Weapons and Counting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout with tactical gear including vests, helmets, weapons, scopes, sights, grips, and breaching equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/17b69e9c614d831d178835bba96d887c.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/17b69e9c614d831d178835bba96d887c.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/17b69e9c614d831d178835bba96d887c.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Discord and Find Your Squad</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/d6848e5b3792a931c21a10d439c41f83.poster.avif?t=1783960546\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/d6848e5b3792a931c21a10d439c41f83.webm?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314160/extras/d6848e5b3792a931c21a10d439c41f83.mp4?t=1783960546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core with Hyper-Threading<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 / AMD RX 480 equivalent or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3, Meta Quest 3S, Valve Index, HTC Vive, Reverb G2</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["HammerFire Interactive"],"publishers":["HammerFire Interactive"],"release_date":"26 Mar, 2023"}